  <data name="StoryPageOverviewText1.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>在過去的一段時間裡，</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageOverviewText2.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>您與音樂，相逢一場</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageOverviewCountUnit.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>次</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageOverviewText3.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>與旋律相伴，不負時光</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageOverviewHourUnit.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>小時</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTimeText1.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>您總愛在</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTimeText2.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>把心事交給旋律聽，</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTimeText3.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>或許那一刻，星光也懂得共鳴</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTimeText4.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>而在</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTimeText5.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>您更願與夜色同靜</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopArtistText1.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>在人海之中，</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopArtistText2.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>您格外偏愛</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopArtistText3.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>的歌聲，恰似知音</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopArtistText4.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>那段歌聲，陪您走過</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopArtistText5.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>段光陰</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopSongText1.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>有一段旋律，</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopSongText2.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>總在不經意間，撥動心弦……</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopSongText3.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>您將它循環了</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageTopSongText4.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>遍，餘音仍繞心弦</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageStreakText1.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>在</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageStreakText2.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value> 這一天，您隨旋律飄遠，忘了人間還有明天</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageStreakText3.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>您聽了</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageStreakText4.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>首歌，聲聲入弦</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageStreakText5.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>您還保持了</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageStreakText6.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>天，歌未絕弦</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageSpecialMomentText1.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>故事開始的地方，</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageSpecialMomentText2.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>是這首歌，唱給您聽：</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageSpecialMomentText3.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>在</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageSpecialMomentText4.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value> 那天，</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageSpecialMomentText5.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>在</value></data>
  <data name="StoryPageSpecialMomentText6.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value> 您仍聽到天明：</value></data>
